%% Sequence — Coach detecta leak no chat e invoca tool recommend_lesson
%% Spec: Docs/specs/biblioteca-spec-1.md RF-10
%% Ref: ADR-075 (Coach tool), ADR-073 (entitlements), ADR-019 (prompt cache)
%%
%% User pergunta sobre leak; Coach decide invocar recommend_lesson(leakTopic, urgency).
%% Tool consulta DB, anexa hasAccess, grava events coach_recommend, retorna cards.
%% UI renderiza CoachLessonRecommendationCard com CTA conditional ao hasAccess.

sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant Chat as CoachChat UI<br/>(React)
    participant API as POST /api/coach/chat
    participant Coach as CoachService<br/>(continuation loop)
    participant Tools as coachTools registry
    participant Tool as recommendLessonHandler
    participant Storage as storage.ts
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Anth as Anthropic API
    participant UI as CoachMessage<br/>+ LessonRecommendationCard

    U->>Chat: "Acho que estou foldando demais em 3-bet pots"
    Chat->>API: POST /chat {message, conversationId}
    activate API
    API->>Coach: continuation(messages, tools=[...])
    activate Coach

    Note over Coach,Anth: 1. Bloco static cacheado (ADR-019)<br/>contem COMPETITOR_BLOCKLIST + SAFETY_RULES_COMPETITOR_BLOCK

    Coach->>Anth: messages.create<br/>(system: cached + dynamic; tools incluem recommend_lesson<br/>filtrado por tier user — Pro ve tool, Free nao)
    activate Anth
    Anth-->>Coach: {role:assistant, content:[<br/>{type:'tool_use', name:'recommend_lesson',<br/>input:{leakTopic:'postflop', urgency:'medium', maxResults:3}}<br/>]}
    deactivate Anth

    Coach->>Tools: invoke('recommend_lesson', input, ctx)
    Tools->>Tool: handler(input, {user, conversationId})
    activate Tool

    Note over Tool,DB: 2. Ranking determinista (D14)

    Tool->>Storage: findLessonsByCategory('postflop', limit=9)
    Storage->>DB: SELECT l.*, c.slug AS courseSlug, c.title AS courseTitle<br/>FROM library_lessons l<br/>JOIN library_courses c ON c.id = l.courseId<br/>WHERE l.categoryId='postflop' AND l.isPublished=true<br/>ORDER BY l.displayOrder LIMIT 9
    DB-->>Storage: [lesson1, lesson2, lesson3]
    Storage-->>Tool: lessons (3 matches)

    alt lessons.length < maxResults
        Tool->>Storage: findLessonsByTag('postflop', exclude=ids, limit=remaining)
        Storage->>DB: SELECT ... WHERE 'postflop' = ANY(tags) AND id NOT IN (...) LIMIT n
        DB-->>Storage: tagged lessons
        Storage-->>Tool: appended
    end

    Tool->>Storage: lessonProgressLookup(userId, lessonIds)
    Storage->>DB: SELECT lessonId, format, completedAt<br/>FROM library_progress<br/>WHERE userId=$u AND lessonId IN (...)
    DB-->>Storage: progress map
    Storage-->>Tool: rank: nao-iniciada > iniciada > completa

    Tool->>Storage: lessonAccessLookup(userId, lessonIds)
    Storage->>DB: SELECT lessonId FROM user_lesson_access<br/>WHERE userId=$u AND lessonId IN (...)<br/>AND (expiresAt IS NULL OR expiresAt > NOW())
    DB-->>Storage: Set<lessonId>
    Storage-->>Tool: access map

    Note over Tool,DB: 3. Side-effect: events coach_recommend (best-effort)

    Tool->>Storage: recordLibraryEvents([{userId, lessonId, eventType:'coach_recommend', metadata:{leakTopic, urgency}} x N])
    Storage->>DB: INSERT INTO library_events ... (try/catch, log error mas nao falha tool)
    DB-->>Storage: ok
    Tool-->>Tools: {__type:'ToolResult', tool:'recommend_lesson', ok:true,<br/>data:{lessons:[{id, slug, courseSlug, title, courseTitle, coverUrl,<br/>durationMinutes, categoryId, hasAccess, url}]}}
    deactivate Tool

    Tools-->>Coach: tool result wrapped (ADR-024)

    Coach->>Anth: messages.create<br/>(append tool_result)
    activate Anth
    Anth-->>Coach: {role:assistant, content:[<br/>{type:'text', text:'Vejo no seu HUD que voce esta foldando 19% das vezes em<br/>3-bet pots — leak classico de postflop OOP. Aqui estao 3 aulas que vao destravar isso:'}]}
    deactivate Anth

    Coach-->>API: final response {messageId, content, toolResults}
    deactivate Coach
    API-->>Chat: 200 {messages, toolResults}
    deactivate API

    Chat->>UI: render CoachMessage com tool result
    UI->>UI: detect tool='recommend_lesson' →<br/>render CoachLessonRecommendationCard (carousel se >1)
    UI-->>U: 3 cards: "M3 - 3-bet" (Assistir), "M5 - OOP" (Assistir), "M7 - C-bet" (Em breve)

    U->>UI: click "Assistir agora" no Card 1
    UI->>UI: window.open(url, '_blank')
    UI-->>U: nova aba com /biblioteca/curso/anatomia-spot/m3-3bet
